      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holborn"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "St Etheldreda's Church in Ely Place began as the chapel of the Bishop of Ely's London palace.",
